WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:10.990
Here in a tranquil and secluded rural setting,
Benjamin Harnwell's mission is to establish

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:17.119
a training center in a former monastery here
in Trisulti....an academy with extremely conservative

00:00:17.119 --> 00:00:20.390
outlooks.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:26.260
With his so-called Institute for Human Dignity,
Harnwell has set himself an ambitious goal

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:32.960
– to save Western Civilization, mobilizing
Christians and Jews in the fight against Islam

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.810
as he refers to religious role models for
his mission.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:42.480
"This depiction here behind me is the martyrdom
of Saint Bartholomew.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.010
He was skinned alive for his beliefs in Jesus
Christ.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:51.760
You've got to remember that today in the world
Christianity is the world's most persecuted

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.100
religion.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.210
We often forget that in the West."

00:00:56.210 --> 00:01:02.030
The academy aims to train budding young politicians
to become staunch Catholics and right-wing

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.030
populists.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:10.060
"Trisulti in the next generation is going
to become the global headquarters of the fight

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:16.210
to defend the Judeo-Christian basis of Western
Civilization, not just here in Europe but

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:18.570
right across the world."

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:24.330
The Catholics seem to look on Steve Bannon
as the ideal partner for the project -- Donald

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:30.670
Trump's former chief strategist regularly
meets with Hartwell in Rome.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:36.820
They first met when Bannon ran the ultra conservative
Breitbart News website.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.130
Bannon is enthusiastic about Harnwell's project.

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:46.409
"I'm just honored he's asked me to help out,
and what I'm trying to do is add maybe a little

00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:54.130
organizational ability and bring in donors,
faculty people I know throughout the world

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.940
that can teach."

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.930
Bannon wants to bring together populist and
identitarian forces in Italy and other European

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:01.930
countries.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:06.650
A patronage by conservative Catholics suits
his cause very well.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.530
He also has his eye on next month's European
Parliament elections.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:17.280
"That's what their fear is, because the populist
nationalist sovereignty movement has great

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.560
politicians, a great message, and now it has
traction.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:28.940
And that's why it's on the cusp, maybe, if
the momentum keeps, through Spain and other

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:32.480
nations, a stunning victory in May."

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:37.880
For Bannon, the academy should become an ideal
breeding ground for his crusaders.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:43.230
Among its backers are ultra-conservative circles
within the Vatican -- who reject Pope Francis's

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:52.160
liberal calls for inclusion and support for
immigrants.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:56.599
The American Cardinal Raymond Leo Burke is
head of the board of advisers of the Institute

00:02:56.599 --> 00:02:59.849
in Trisulti.

00:02:59.849 --> 00:03:09.660
He has openly endorsed Donald Trump's conservative
agenda in the United States.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:15.280
Critics see the emergence as an unholy alliance
that will seek to use Trisulti to undermine

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:21.890
pluralist democratic societies, led by arch-conservative
Catholics who rely on the help of political

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:25.319
agitators like Steve Bannon.

00:03:25.319 --> 00:03:32.880
"What they have in common is this obsessive
cult of identity.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:38.680
They say: We represent Christendom, Western
Civilization, Europe, founded on Judeo-Christian

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:49.000
values, and we are being invaded, so we must
defend ourselves."

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:54.650
Many local residents in Trisulti have launched
protests -- they don't want Steve Bannon and

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.879
far-right populists here.

00:03:57.879 --> 00:04:04.550
The monastery is a religious site, both a
place of pilgrimage and a tourist attraction.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:08.370
They want the government to rescind the lease
on the property.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:13.181
"Why is a local monastery being used for an
ideological project?

00:04:13.181 --> 00:04:19.070
Trisulti will become the launchpad for a movement.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:28.660
Just look at its ideas, its sources of finance,
and its goals!"

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.810
Benjamin Harnwell remains confident.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.680
The lease is valid, he says.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.560
The plans to start operations are in place.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.750
What can stop him and Bannon now?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:43.120
"Culture is upstream of politics, and that's
where we're working at.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:50.470
So I think anything we're going to do will
help Matteo Salvini and any of the populist

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:55.800
nationalist movements in Europe or around
the world."

00:04:55.800 --> 00:05:00.750
Harnwell's plans seem clear: Trisulti should
become a launching pad for far-right populists

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:05.351
to take over Europe . One that can count on
the blessing of arch-conservative Catholic

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:13.000
clerics in high places.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.000
The academy aims to start its first courses this summer.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.000
But before that it remains to be seen

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.000
how well the nationalists and populists perform

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.000
in the European elections in May.

